{"id":"conv_04564","context":"A uni student debates a teacher on international affairs","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["ren_uni","asuka_teacher"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Teacher, did you see the recent news? The territorial dispute is causing trouble at the cabinet meeting again.","jp":"先生、最近のニュース見ました？例の領土問題、また閣僚会議で揉めてるみたいですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,7,8,14,17,28,51,79,83,139,223,228,243,439,465,524,628,1999,4497,4781,6739,6904],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"最近","r":"さいきん","w":223},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"ニュース","w":465},{"s":"見","r":"み","w":243},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"？"},{"s":"例","r":"れい","w":524},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"領土","r":"りょうど","w":6739},{"s":"問題","r":"もんだい","w":79},{"s":"、"},{"s":"また","w":83},{"s":"閣僚","r":"かくりょう","w":6904},{"s":"会議","r":"かいぎ","w":628},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"揉め","r":"もめ"},{"s":"てる","w":139},{"s":"みたい","w":439},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Yes, I saw it. But this time there are loud voices saying it should be taken to international arbitration.","jp":"ええ、見ましたよ。でも今回は国際仲裁に持ち込むべきだという声も大きいでしょう。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,8,11,14,17,21,28,29,32,68,88,93,117,169,207,243,398,401,1014,1988,2280,3039,4781,5004,5183,5847,6734,12119],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"見","r":"み","w":243},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"でも","w":88},{"s":"今回","r":"こんかい","w":207},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"国際","r":"こくさい","w":398},{"s":"仲裁","r":"ちゅうさい","w":6734},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"持ち込む","r":"もちこむ","w":12119},{"s":"べき","w":5183},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"という","w":32},{"s":"声","r":"こえ","w":401},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"大きい","r":"おおきい","w":1014},{"s":"でしょ","w":17},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Honestly, I think an arbitrator role is just a waste of time. In the end, the great powers decide everything anyway.",